"P4237778331" "Someone in the Destroyers must know where they're holding Tunnel Rat. If you start introducing Destroyer heads to pavement I'm sure someone will talk."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1244696777" "<shout>Paingod sends his regards, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P181866196" "You learned from these Fixadine freaks that Paingod and Hatefist are holding Tunnel Rat in a Fixadine Den here in Logos."

