// Dialog :
"P1913768027" "You got her out safe?<br><br><color orange>Luke Larson takes off his hat and runs his hand through his hair, letting out a stiff, stress filled exhale.</color><br><br>{HeroName}, you have done the incredible. Not only did you save my fiesty friend and informant, Tunnel Rat, but you also put a stop to some dangerous dealings between the more extreme members of our movement and the psychotic Destroyers. Let's hope that the former learns to choose their friends and allies a little more wisely in the future. If they continue to make friends like these, the Resistance won't need enemies."
// RandomFameString :
